It also features Stephen Baldwin as Tuff Hedeman,
and Red Mitchell as Cody Lambert.

14
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
The film was completed and premiered shortly after what would
have been Frost's 30th birthday, in late 1993.

15
